--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PURPOSE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Detection of third-party accessibility-overlay widgets on a target HTML
page. Pattern-matches against a curated registry of per-vendor static
signatures (script URLs, DOM ids, class prefixes, custom attributes,
global JS variables, iframe-src patterns) and returns a structured
machine-readable report with verbatim citation of the W3C-WAI
Accessibility Overlay community position and the OverlayFactsheet
community statement.

Detection only. The package does NOT recommend removal of any vendor,
does NOT auto-fail a scan, does NOT auto-disable any widget, and does
NOT issue a WCAG / EAA non-conformance verdict.

