DISCLAIMER — NOT LEGAL ADVICE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Detection is mechanical pattern-matching. The fact a vendor is present
does not by itself prove WCAG / EAA non-conformance. The output of this
package is intended for compliance documentation and is not a substitute
for advice from qualified counsel.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NO RUNTIME THIRD-PARTY DEPENDENCIES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package ships with zero third-party runtime dependencies. All
matching is performed against caller-supplied serialised HTML using the
Node.js standard library only. No outbound network calls are made by
this package; URL inputs are delegated to a caller-supplied fetcher.
